o manual verification from listing/panel content was the correct approach.\n\nThe agent completed the search, applied the correct filter, correctly distinguished 24-hour locksmiths from non-24-hour ones, and provided verified results with supporting details.\n\n## Final Verdict: **SUCCESS**",
